{
  "ID": "55415",
  "post_title": "Gran animación en la 'Trobada de Boixets' de Onda",
  "post_date": "2015-04-26 10:30:21",
  "post_name": "la-trobada-de-boixets-del-domingo-en-onda-contara-con-una-muestra-comercial",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Economía|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_3304.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La &#39;Trobada de Boixets&#39; (bolillos) de Onda, que se celebra este domingo en el pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda, dentro de la IV Semana Cultural, se puede visitar hasta las 14 horas y presenta gran animaci&oacute;n, especialmente la muestra comercial en el and&eacute;n central , en la que participan Lluna Estilistes,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/2casetaNubesAzucar.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Nubes de Az&uacute;car o Fontaner&iacute;a Mu&ntilde;oz.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/CasetaFntaneriaMuñoz.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n hay una mesa solidaria de la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/3casetaACCC.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Poco antes de las 11 horas se han acabado de montar los hinchables de DiverTwin,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_3357.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>que se complementan con los talleres infantiles.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/1casetallunaestilistes.jpg\" alt=\"1casetallunaestilistes\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/2casetanubesazucar.jpg\" alt=\"2casetanubesazucar\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/3casetaaccc.jpg\" alt=\"3casetaaccc\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/casetafntaneriamunoz.jpg\" alt=\"casetafntaneriamunoz\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/casetalestacio.jpg\" alt=\"casetalestacio\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/casetarestauro.jpg\" alt=\"casetarestauro\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3279.jpg\" alt=\"img_3279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3281.jpg\" alt=\"img_3281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3282.jpg\" alt=\"img_3282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3283.jpg\" alt=\"img_3283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3285.jpg\" alt=\"img_3285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3296.jpg\" alt=\"img_3296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3298.jpg\" alt=\"img_3298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3302.jpg\" alt=\"img_3302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadaboixets1ahora/img_3304.jpg\" alt=\"img_3304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25df